AKEDORE kernel 4.19 for POCO F1 (beryllium)
===========================================

  Custom Linux 4.19.325 kernel for the POCO F1, for 4.19 ROMs.
  Based on Aozora 4.19 by Kaiyaa77. Formerly "fsociety kernel".

Builds
------

  KSU    KernelSU 32704 (official KernelSU manager, 32704)
  NoSU   no root (for Magisk or no root)

  Latest: v1. Version text: 5.10.245-akedore-umrsrn-v1-KSU / -NonKSU
  (5.10.245 is Aozora's spoof, the real base is 4.19.325).

Install
-------

  Flash the zip in recovery (back up boot first). 4.19 ROMs only:
  the zip refuses to flash on a 4.9 ROM.

Fixes
-----

  - Standby drain: SoC deep sleep works again (~45 mA screen off).
  - Xiaomi thermal profile and charging temperature limit now work.
  - Phone powering off on reboot: fixed (tested 10-15 reboots).
  - USB not detected after replug: fixed (tested 10-15 replugs).
  - USB file transfer menu on PD laptop ports: fixed.
  - Chrome/Brave crash and bpfloader bootloop on Android 17: fixed.
  - Vibrations >= 1 s, QC2 thermal typo, PD/PPS charging at 25 mA.
  - Battery jumps / shutdown with charge left: fix included, not
    fully tested yet.

Extras
------

  - GPU 710 MHz, auto boost to 802 MHz while gaming.
  - Eco / balanced / game profiles, lower CPU limits with screen off,
    TCP BBR. Settings: /sys/module/fsociety/parameters/.

Notes
-----

  - Double-tap-to-wake on a non-original LCD works only with AOD on.
  - Build: ./build_akedore.sh [ksu|nosu]. Details: CHANGELOG.md.

